# What was installed

- `npm pack` of the working tree produced
  `one-ciel-ai-ciel-runtime-0.2.51.tgz` (563 files, shasum
  978c2e4feb8c2665b36e55310c3bfbd990fd5642) in a temporary directory,
  outside the repository.
- `npm install -g` replaced
  C:\Users\djlov\AppData\Roaming\npm\node_modules\@one-ciel-ai\ciel-runtime
  ("changed 1 package"). package.json still reports 0.2.51, so no registry
  version identifies this build.
- `ciel-runtime --version` prints `ciel-runtime 0.2.51` from the installed
  launcher.

